{ [%eval 0.15] The Colle. White opens the f1 bishop and builds a solid centre. }
3... e6 { [%eval 0.12] Black does the same. } 4. Bd3
{ [%eval 0.12] The bishop looks at h7 and, together with the knight on f3, supports the break that White is waiting for. Remember the plan of the system: pawns on d4 and e3, bishop on d3, knights on f3 and d2, castle, then e4. }
